  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_01",
      "hash64": "D8EAE990BCF2D5B0",
      "text": "¿Qué, mola o no mola la arena de la\\nPlaza Polar?[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_02",
      "hash64": "D8EAEC90BCF2DAC9",
      "text": "Bueh, supongo que es igual que las otras, solo\\nque aquí hace un frío que pela.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_03",
      "hash64": "D8EAEB90BCF2D916",
      "text": "Yo siempre he sido más de frío que de calor,\\nla verdad.\\c\\n¿Qué, no es lo que esperabas de alguien que\\nusa Pokémon de tipo Dragón?[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 130,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_04",
      "hash64": "D8EAEE90BCF2DE2F",
      "text": "Bueno, colega, no me ando con más rodeos,\\nque tú has venido a lo que has venido.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_05",
      "hash64": "D8EAED90BCF2DC7C",
      "text": "¡Mi reto consiste en una serie de [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]combates[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]biodómicos[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 51,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_06",
      "hash64": "D8EAF090BCF2E195",
      "text": "No tiene mucho misterio: ¡vence a tres miembros\\ndel Club de la Liga en combate y reto superado![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_07",
      "hash64": "D8EAEF90BCF2DFE2",
      "text": "Aunque, como te habrás imaginado por el\\nnombre, hay un par de restricciones que se\\r\\naplican al equipo que vayas a usar.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 121,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_10",
      "hash64": "D8E78490BCEFF43A",
      "text": "La primera: ¡Tienes que usar Pokémon salvajes\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]capturados en el Biodomo[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_12",
      "hash64": "D8E78290BCEFF0D4",
      "text": "La segunda: Nada de Pokémon intercambiados.\\n¡Tienes que haberlos [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]capturado tú mism[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_13",
      "hash64": "D8E78390BCEFF287",
      "text": "Si llevas algún Pokémon que incumpla las normas,\\nno podrás desafiar a nadie a un combate.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_14",
      "hash64": "D8E78090BCEFED6E",
      "text": "Ya, ya sé que es un rollo tener que abrir las cajas\\npara reestructurar el equipo y tal y cual, pero...\\c\\n¡Había que hacerlo interesante! Dejarte usar los\\nmismos Pokémon de siempre no tendría gracia.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 102,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 199,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_15",
      "hash64": "D8E78190BCEFEF21",
      "text": "Y, oye, tus adversarios están en las mismas que\\ntú, ¡así que no te me quejes![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_16",
      "hash64": "D8E77E90BCEFEA08",
      "text": "Bien, ¡¿estás list[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa para hacer frente a mi reto del\\nAlto Mando, colega?![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_select_01",
      "hash64": "2F6D9CFA77AE15BD",
      "text": "¡Sí!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_select_02",
      "hash64": "2F6D99FA77AE10A4",
      "text": "¿Me lo explicas otra vez?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_select_03",
      "hash64": "2F6D9AFA77AE1257",
      "text": "En otra ocasión",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_17",
      "hash64": "D8E77F90BCEFEBBB",
      "text": "¡De lujo! ¡A vuestros puestos, equipo![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_enemy_all_01",
      "hash64": "C7BA86F4AC3BE73F",
      "text": "                    ¡Iremos a por todas!\\n¡Es un placer!                  ¡A hacer la combatición![VAR 0x0114(004D)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_18",
      "hash64": "D8E77C90BCEFE6A2",
      "text": "Aquí nunca vamos con prisas, no es mi estilo.\\nAsí que tómatelo con calma.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_19",
      "hash64": "D8E77D90BCEFE855",
      "text": "Puedes enfrentarte a estos tres cuando tú veas.\\nAhora mismo, si te apetece...[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_20",
      "hash64": "D8E3FE90BCECDAB1",
      "text": "O bien puedes recorrerte primero el Biodomo\\npara atrapar más Pokémon. Depende de ti.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_21",
      "hash64": "D8E3FD90BCECD8FE",
      "text": "Venga, pues sin prisas, como ya he dicho.\\n¡Suerte a todos![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 58,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_npc",
      "hash64": "9FCE05EF699E9EFA",
      "text": "¡Puedes ir a tu ritmo! ¡Ponte con los combates si\\nquieres, o ve a recorrerte con calma el Biodomo!\\c\\nAquí no metemos prisa a nadie.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 132,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_enemy_a_01",
      "hash64": "60B74CB7C5C4B4DF",
      "text": "A mí me van los Pokémon de tonos grisáceos\\ny pardos. ¿Te apetece luchar ahora?",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_enemy_a_04",
      "hash64": "60B747B7C5C4AC60",
      "text": "Vaya marrón... ¡Parece que tu[VAR 0x1101(00FD,0100)]s Pokémon no\\ncumple[VAR 0x1101(00FD,0100)]n con los requisitos!\\c\\nRecuerda que solo puedes luchar con Pokémon\\nque hayas atrapado tú mism[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa en el Biodomo.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1101",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FD",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1101",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FD",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 153,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_enemy_a_02",
      "hash64": "60B74DB7C5C4B692",
      "text": "¡Caqui pistachi! ¡Vamos allá!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_enemy_a_03",
      "hash64": "60B74EB7C5C4B845",
      "text": "¡Espero que termines el reto sin morder el polvo!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_enemy_b_01",
      "hash64": "377F54C3104234C8",
      "text": "Todos mis amigos me dicen que soy muy fría...\\n¿List[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa para que te haga tiritar?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 51,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_enemy_b_04",
      "hash64": "377F59C310423D47",
      "text": "¡Pero si no cumples con los requisitos!\\c\\nSolo puedes usar Pokémon atrapados en el\\nBiodomo. Y tienes que haberlos atrapado tú.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_enemy_b_02",
      "hash64": "377F57C3104239E1",
      "text": "Je, je... ¡Tú lo has querido!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_enemy_b_03",
      "hash64": "377F56C31042382E",
      "text": "Ánimo con el reto, que el frío se pasa mejor\\ncombatiendo.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_enemy_c_01",
      "hash64": "638660C971AC4DDD",
      "text": "¿Conoces a e-Nigma, la streamer? Soy superfán,\\nasí que uso el mismo tipo que ella. ¿Luchamos?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_enemy_c_04",
      "hash64": "63865BC971AC455E",
